// chriz-iwd-encounters 370: on top of the first script of the real Pomab and of each
// image. Once a revealing spell has shown what it is (POMAB_ILLUSION, set by its own
// reveal block) and the shuffle has hidden it again (Detect Illusions back to 20),
// it can be revealed again and carries the real Pomab's name.

IF
  Global("POMAB_ILLUSION","LOCALS",1)
  CheckStatGT(Myself,19,DETECTILLUSIONS)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("POMAB_ILLUSION","LOCALS",0)
    SetName(%cie_cry_name%)
    Continue()
END
